cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper below."
title: >-
  Reading Acquisition Order out of BabyLM Representations: Child-Scale Training
  Produces Developmentally Aligned Semantic Spaces
abstract: >-
  A frozen linear read-out is fit to Wordbank CDI age-of-acquisition from the layer-wise
  word representations of 18 checkpoints, spanning BabyLM child-scale models and
  full-data controls, to test whether developmentally plausible training data yields
  representations better aligned with children's vocabulary learning order.
